  "body": "## Summary\n\n```text\nReplicationFeed\n  capture journal source and subscribe to durable updates\n  if the captured image could contain an over-bound entry\n    scan the pinned source off the actor thread\n    if oversized\n      force one existing-path compaction when legal\n      otherwise report ordinal, encoded size, bound, and recovery guidance\n  return the refreshed snapshot source\n```\n\nSmall journals keep the original fast path; compaction publishes a reset to existing feeds while the new feed starts from the compacted snapshot.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Before: an oversized legacy entry reached `split_entry_payload` as a bare `PayloadTooLarge`.\n- After: synthetic legacy-checkpoint tests verify forced compaction plus signed-frame acceptance, the actionable no-program error, and the no-compaction fast path.\n- `cargo test -p id --lib world::actor::replication_feed_tests` — 7 passed.\n- `cargo test -p id --lib world::replication` — 31 passed.\n- `cargo test -p id --lib world_store` — 36 passed.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** Two-way; the actor/feed behavior can be reverted without a data-format or wire-protocol change.\n\n**Blast Radius:** Small; only worlds with an oversized journal entry take the new compaction/error path.\n\nCloses #4967.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796778072&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7890&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7890&signature=e9cca1af853e2b653311fe925311ef0fc8c91705b1cc1a35dcdcec6106d8a33d\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7890?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
